2026-07-27T07:53:09.4518856Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:53:09.4519495Z i /tmp/Rtmp7ics7N/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:53:09.4519928Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:53:09.4520668Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:53:09.4521618Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:53:09.4522323Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:53:09.4523539Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:53:09.4524327Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:53:09.4780090Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:53:09.4896011Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:53:09.5368520Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:53:09.5553003Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
